---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI use - Joacim Eldre"
  description="How and why I use generative artificial intelligence to make a small part of this website."
>
  <section>
    <div class="pt-16">
    <h1 class="typo-display-xl">
        How I use AI on this website.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 typo-main">
        I've used generative artificial intelligence to help me create the stackable decagon in the footer, for the latest Bluesky post integration that fetches the latest post from my Bluesky profile, and for the tag system used in posts.
    </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
